      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thanks for the report! Like @{5f2dc5e7d99b4d10db4a527d|full_name} said, `IsInstanceOwner` is always false for public or group instances. That's intentional! We updated our documentation: https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/networking/network-components/#networking-properties\n\nPlease let us know if you have any additional feedback.",
